WEBVTT

00:25:59.157 --> 00:26:01.431
is just inevitably going to involve

00:26:01.455 --> 00:26:05.010
a lot more exposure
of our lives to someone,

00:26:05.034 --> 00:26:08.402
whether it's a corporation
or a society as a whole or the government.

00:26:08.716 --> 00:26:10.874
And that it will feel uncomfortable,

00:26:10.898 --> 00:26:13.358
and that there may be
some bad consequences from it,

00:26:13.382 --> 00:26:15.636
there may also be very good
consequences from it

00:26:15.660 --> 00:26:19.695
and we may have to get used to embracing
some of that discomfort.

00:26:19.719 --> 00:26:22.490
Perhaps adopting more of Chinese thinking,

00:26:22.514 --> 00:26:25.519
of "this is for the good of society."

00:26:26.109 --> 00:26:29.014
KFL: Well, let's take an American example.

00:26:29.038 --> 00:26:34.802
So, I've worked in many companies
that have gotten into lawsuits, antitrust,